message: "If you use NatSci-Writing-skills, please cite the related paper (to be updated when published) and this repository."
title: "NatSci-Writing-skills: a production system for Nature/Science-level manuscripts and figures"
abstract: "Two self-contained agent skills (English and Chinese) for complete manuscript drafting, figure production, revision, journal formatting and reviewer response, built from the author's research projects and long-term conversations and integrating the open-source nature-skills project with attribution."
